cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: lammpc
abstract: >-
  lammpc is a C ABI for evaluating LAMMPS interaction models in process. It
  uses flat Cap'n Proto messages from potentials-schema. The library provides
  persistent sessions, projected Langevin dynamics, unconstrained NVE
  dynamics, and host callbacks for hard boundaries.
authors:
